[Eclipse SUMO 1.27.1 via TraCI · buildings: Overture Maps · MapLibre]

58
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,000
11 · The ambulance in SUMO (make demo-ambulance)

59
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:47,033
The study's own simulation on the Dhaka corridor, seed 11: the ambulance (white, green cross) gets through; cars it alerts turn orange and move aside; signals ahead turn green. 292 s without the alert, 284 s with it, the same as the saved study run.
[Eclipse SUMO 1.27.1 (sumo-gui) via TraCI · make-way rule v2 (SUMO bluelight settings; 100 m is our choice) · offline, on this laptop]

